{"posts":[{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_76","t":"Away\n\nYes, you got nice FO but that FO need to engulf previous swing high to make it as QM.I'm just trying to go with flow before any major breakdown to South. Yes there might be orders left. but when they will collect those orders is really Q. they might not collect in coming years as well. Think from ITs perspective, if I want bigger profits will I set any mid as my target instead I will look for where retailers were buying at top and selling at bottom. then I will look for trick there.","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#76","p":4,"im":[],"m":76},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_77","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#77","p":4,"im":["b7fe66d9a8fba58e77e32bbf00a86d9c2ec5ef8a","1cf21ecf42dfa9e365103875ac045c6920c950d0"],"m":77},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_78","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#78","p":4,"im":["f3b49e5a6aa702fb89aca8a5a5586bf3f6f9a247","d7e5c1b1490f46fad573947fc9aaafa7ccc161e5"],"m":78},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_79","t":"Away\n\nOOM engulfed in this scale with upper PAZ made FO. so we have unreached demand below with retailers traps set. though the possibilty of FO in demand can't be neglected as price turned very close to it. though this demand I marked more sounds like retailer demand as we have hammerlike structure right below. I have to consider this as demand as PA is made and no good data available on left for analysis.\n\n1 more thing to note is we have reached to OOM of HTF. that's another PA encourging me to look for getting bucks out of the markets","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#79","p":4,"im":["35edacad34c31b47ec6acd4ecbd2fbb5b2255772","f89cc04c18960e66d08bd75bccd339f8a787442f"],"m":79},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_80","t":"Away\n\nkavya wrote:\n\nSo looking at Gold trade and current reaction one thing is clear,to reap out the retailers skin ITs might create engulf even before they are not nearby targets. and then with liquidity gap can push prices strongly to target level. So engulfing might have happened much earlier. and which is exciting me to look for such PAs.\n\nWe have Nice reversal in Gold for quite long time!","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#80","p":4,"im":["f3b49e5a6aa702fb89aca8a5a5586bf3f6f9a247","d7e5c1b1490f46fad573947fc9aaafa7ccc161e5","bfa68f92224cad608557c2253c8f389d16289ef1","baa1b6f07da77f7de4fa71d7d458d1cea2dbc1bb"],"m":80},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_81","t":"Kavya","a":"—","d":"","n":"#81","p":4,"im":[],"m":81},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_82","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#82","p":4,"im":["80d3721df0c9922b112bc7c15fec8fb64f6253a6","cb5acc7baf14883ad591fada8e9dbbb4f0e8d2ac","35e49436749a110efdd67a8eafc35b8937f37714","3ab4d63c0a4a30dfd99ee5164b91fa0f1a100289","befd9b9a2da25ae8ac1af728543399cff3dfebb5"],"m":82},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_83","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#83","p":4,"im":["e97c5261414e44030731c48ab8933ac166993a17","ec7cbfc5ad51f2aeb33c449234ec270dc465cbd9"],"m":83},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_84","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#84","p":4,"im":["93c387d727b016d1937738da6fc037ebde9f4622"],"m":84},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_85","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#85","p":4,"im":["ad6262f7459fc93d5bf56b99134e95d4f3ef17ab"],"m":85},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_86","t":"Away\n\nThanks you bro! Sali and IF. If was very difficult to understand what is usable engulf or which one is real engulf and which one isn't. Though I have looked and found IF's single chart for CP1.It was really new Eureka for my Q's.\n\nNow in words what I understood on charts. Initially I started looking for CP but before that I need to look for engulf. Now which engulf I required was Q, so I decided to look for FL as this are the only levels which are Fresh and Authentic. Engulf of this levels is really important single for ITs and so should be for us. But then encountered error 404. there are many FL so which one should I look for. Upper one, middle one or Lower one? Then I remembered Sali's ORFL so I just considered to give try to this concept first. but at the first attempt of my exercise I found that supply traded RS of the CP coming down. and ORFL of that was engulfed and new orders were come into market. but again there are lot of ORFLs in market which are getting engulfed. So going forward I started looking Swing Highs and Low left to those ORFLs. Engulfing of this Highs and Lows really made things more simple. Now atleast look for few nice confirmed entries. but still have to give more try on other forms of CPs!","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#86","p":4,"im":[],"m":86},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_87","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#87","p":4,"im":["780b4489d5b17da224aaa127ba85cbdc09369f8b"],"m":87},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_88","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#88","p":4,"im":["77a42deee20b55b8fbd15ec4795a458b71691ef7"],"m":88},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_89","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#89","p":4,"im":["297f7e82dbd5ad46afc4b225d4a5f3bc0c90bfe8","87555195a37a449ea4c13f6d50a9fd5a1649e1f4"],"m":89},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_90","t":"Away\n\nSo here's my thinking going on.what should we look for previous ignored FL for trading it next time.\n\nFirst and foremost and very important thing is when we look for Supply FL which got neglected during down move. price should have reached to supply CAPS. In other term, it should have hitted the target for longs.\n\nSecond thing -- Price should have broken (engulfed) the low it come from.\n\nThird thing -- the FL should be reaction to CAPS (might be wrong, needs back-testing)!\n\nand last thing any corrections are most welcome and this in testing phase!","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#90","p":4,"im":[],"m":90},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_91","t":"Away\n\nThough we reached to the FL supply zone on BEML, the PA is yet to be made. Approach was nice with rising wedges which are reversal pattern and now we are sitting into Monthly, Weekly as well as Daily Supply zone Possibility of FO is not neglected as the current FL is just below the what appears to be CAPS on price with RS as Resistance for price.","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#91","p":4,"im":["1ac479752564dc1c46c0e789afd46ff4ed065a2c"],"m":91},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_92","t":"Away\n\nWith a flag broken on Quarterly and price entered into the Compression there is only way up till the CAPS on price.\n\nWith weekly chart showing nice Demand FL created by ITs, it's time to accumulate in Lower Scale. With nice CAPS on price as a trap for retailers and scalpers, I can certainly look to accumulate on this script with at least 3 times return in coming years.","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#92","p":4,"im":["345283fb44e29fcb98b7b7242d3140035c59a500","539c1947c5add566e951ff9f7fa75cc88feabb2b","2d5f026d864cb07dac2f707f8c6d80be422eb11f","a0a7d4d2cae337273d2761a615952b4acda49fc8","1477c1c775e96d9506ab1bfd973b25887c8ff2fd"],"m":92},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_93","t":"Away\n\nGold 5m kink also matching with the Old close on Weekly Demand candle which was later on engulfed. ITs will surely retest that.","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#93","p":4,"im":["157484f10e938705a1202d9e268de44ed4737efe"],"m":93},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_94","t":"Away\n\nNiftyMetal has formed Diamond into FL! Now only I have to wait for price to trigger pending orders left behind.","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#94","p":4,"im":["d3c73b6c8e0cfd538eb670b15afb11a690aee8be"],"m":94},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_95","t":"Away\n\n1. Are LS FLs (Ks) are more important than Fresh DBRs? 2. Is Engulf into Space mean price reacting to LQG?\n\nCorrect my understanding --\n\nIf price is having say QM level or Swing High to current Swing HH. then FTR formed after engulf of FL or current Swing HH, we can take entry for Right Shoulder","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#95","p":4,"im":["dcc57599c75019924ad2a2b90e007344b15cf05a"],"m":95},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_96","t":"Away\n\nLet's get started with what knowledge I got till now from RTM as well as from various other resources. The base was definitely provided by OTA, and my curiosity about why few levels works and few not brought me here in RTM. Now it's almost 1 year of being the member of this well advanced and well guided community, it's time to start little advance version of me from fresh. It's never guilt or shame to look into past and take few lessons out of it. After all this is all RTM is about! Look left Trade right! Let's get started with v2.0! -- The rulebook of Supply and Demand.","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#96","p":4,"im":[],"m":96},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_97","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#97","p":4,"im":["4caaf9abe47dde02f8edd96484cbf4054baf1ba4"],"m":97},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_98","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#98","p":4,"im":["9a9f9358ec85bcbaa9b719cc88a933ecf6a5a6d4"],"m":98},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_99","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#99","p":4,"im":["039280a45025e15fedc008ff66aa5e4f43a7a909"],"m":99},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p4_100","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#100","p":4,"im":["8e4209326a94eedd13ea6db59a1cf23ec16ea4e7"],"m":100}],"images":[{"k":"b7fe66d9a8fba58e77e32bbf00a86d9c2ec5ef8a","t":"assets/thumbs/b7fe66d9a8fba58e77e32bbf00a86d9c2ec5ef8a.webp","f":"assets/images/b7fe66d9a8fba58e77e32bbf00a86d9c2ec5ef8a.png","w":1131,"h":712,"b":43972,"o":"b7fe66d9a8fba58e77e32bbf00a86d9c2ec5ef8a.png","p":4,"pid":"homeoffinisher_p4_77"},{"k":"1cf21ecf42dfa9e365103875ac045c6920c950d0","t":"assets/thumbs/1cf21ecf42dfa9e365103875ac045c6920c950d0.webp","f":"assets/images/1cf21ecf42dfa9e365103875ac045c6920c950d0.png","w":1131,"h":712,"b":44394,"o":"1cf21ecf42dfa9e365103875ac045c6920c950d0.png","p":4,"pid":"homeoffinisher_p4_77"},{"k":"f3b49e5a6aa702fb89aca8a5a5586bf3f6f9a247","t":"assets/thumbs/f3b49e5a6aa702fb89aca8a5a5586bf3f6f9a247.webp","f":"assets/images/f3b49e5a6aa702fb89aca8a5a5586bf3f6f9a247.png","w":1131,"h":712,"b":49525,"o":"f3b49e5a6aa702fb89aca8a5a5586bf3f6f9a247.png","p":4,"pid":"homeoffinisher_p4_80"},{"k":"d7e5c1b1490f46fad573947fc9aaafa7ccc161e5","t":"assets/thumbs/d7e5c1b1490f46fad573947fc9aaafa7ccc161e5.webp","f":"assets/images/d7e5c1b1490f46fad573947fc9aaafa7ccc161e5.png","w":1131,"h":673,"b"